---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import ContactBand from '../components/ContactBand.astro';
import WorkExplorer from '../components/WorkExplorer.astro';
import StoryScene from '../components/StoryScene.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
import {projects} from '../data/projects';
const pick=(ids:string[])=>ids.map(id=>projects.find(p=>p.id===id)!);
/* zenith is maintenance work, not a build, so it sits with the upkeep beat and not on the laptop */
const built=pick(['orias','gawangdiwa','cowmit']), steps=pick(['balzy','artin','komforten','zenith']), wired=pick(['vendrato']);
/* websites built by Vendrato, where Marv is a partner and consultant; shown as studio work, not as his own builds */
const studio=[{slug:'ushh',img:'ushh',name:'Urdaneta Sacred Heart Hospital',kind:'Hospital site with doctor search'},{slug:'japanese-4x4',img:'japanese4x4',name:'Japanese 4x4',kind:'Truck and equipment inventory'},{slug:'create-in-subic',img:'createinsubic',name:'Create in Subic',kind:'Creative house and community'}];
/* Vendrato concept studies: design proposals for real businesses, one per trade. Labelled as concepts, not client work. */
const concepts=[{slug:'smiths-fencing',name:'Smiths Fencing and Gates',trade:'Construction'},{slug:'mountain-paradise',name:'Mountain Paradise Landscaping',trade:'Landscaping'},{slug:'pestman-tasmania',name:'Shearwater Pest Management',trade:'Pest control'},{slug:'nkh-solicitors',name:'Nelson Keane & Hemingway Lawyers',trade:'Law'},{slug:'newcorppools',name:'Newcorp Pools',trade:'Pool builders'},{slug:'deonshaw',name:'Deon Shaw Concreting',trade:'Concreting'},{slug:'hoopertrees',name:'Hooper Trees',trade:'Tree services'},{slug:'mcgarchitects',name:'MCG Architects',trade:'Architecture'}];
---
<Site title="Websites, and what happens after the click" description="Marv Pacinabao is a partner and consultant at Vendrato. He builds websites and storefronts and connects them to the CRM, booking, automations and tracking behind them.">
<section class="st-story" id="st-story">
<StoryScene/>
<div class="st-beats">
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h1>Websites, and what happens after the click.</h1><p class="st-lede">I’m Marv, a partner and consultant at Vendrato. I build websites and storefronts, then connect them to the CRM, booking, automations and tracking that turn a visit into a customer.</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="button button-blue" href="https://vendrato.com/book">Book a free call</a><a class="button st-ghost" href="#selected-work">See the work</a></div></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat" id="story"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>I learned to check things twice.</h2><p>My first trade was aircraft maintenance and inspection. You follow the checklist, you troubleshoot in order, and you never sign off on something you didn’t look at. I left the trade. The habit came with me.</p><a class="text-link" href="/aviation/">My aviation background</a></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>Then I wanted to make the thing myself.</h2><p>After a stretch doing outreach and partnerships at a startup, I learned HTML, CSS and JavaScript by hand. Page builders came later. When Elementor or a Shopify section misbehaves now, I know where to look.</p><ul class="st-tiles" data-n={built.length} aria-label="Projects built this way">{built.map(p=><li><a href={`/work/${p.id}/`}><img src={`/images/shots/${p.id}.webp`} width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" alt=""/><b>{p.name}</b><span>{p.kind}</span></a></li>)}</ul></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>A page is one step, not the whole trip.</h2><p>Supporting a Sweden-based brand, I built Shopify pages, kept Funnelish funnels updated, handled translations and ran QA before campaigns. A page sits between an ad and a checkout. I build it knowing both sides.</p><ul class="st-tiles" data-n={steps.length} aria-label="Projects along the funnel">{steps.map(p=><li><a href={`/work/${p.id}/`}><img src={`/images/shots/${p.id}.webp`} width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" alt=""/><b>{p.name}</b><span>{p.kind}</span></a></li>)}</ul></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>Then it has to connect to something.</h2><p>A page that takes an enquiry and stops there is half a job. The other half is what nobody sees: GoHighLevel pipelines and workflows, booking and reminders, Make and n8n automations, and the tracking that shows which ad paid for itself. I build that with <a class="st-inline" href="https://vendrato.com/">Vendrato</a>, the web, automation and AI studio where I’m a partner and consultant.</p><ul class="st-tiles" data-n={wired.length} aria-label="Connected project">{wired.map(p=><li><a href={`/work/${p.id}/`}><img src={`/images/shots/${p.id}.webp`} width="1440" height="1000" loading="lazy" alt=""/><b>{p.name}</b><span>{p.kind}</span></a></li>)}</ul></div></div></div>
<div class="st-beat"><div class="wrap"><div class="st-in"><h2>So I’m more than the person who builds the page.</h2><p>With the studio, I work across the website, the CRM behind it and the automations between them, so nothing is lost in a handover. When you book a call, I’m one of the people you’ll talk to.</p><div class="st-cta"><a class="button st-ghost" href="#what-i-do">See what I offer</a></div></div></div></div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="wrap home-reel" id="selected-work"><WorkExplorer/><div class="work-archive-link"><p>Eight projects. Different brands. My attention to the details.</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/">Explore all projects</a></div></div>
<section class="st-offers" id="what-i-do"><div class="wrap">
<div class="st-head"><h2>What I can build for you.</h2><p>I’m a partner and consultant at Vendrato. This is the work I build with the studio, for the businesses we take on.</p></div>
<div class="st-ways">
<article>
<svg class="st-art" viewBox="0 0 120 84" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="8" width="108" height="68" rx="3"/><path d="M6 22h108"/><circle cx="14" cy="15" r="1.6" class="dot"/><circle cx="21" cy="15" r="1.6" class="dot"/><path d="M18 34h44M18 42h30"/><rect x="18" y="52" width="26" height="12" rx="2" class="hot"/><rect x="72" y="32" width="30" height="32" rx="2"/></svg>
<h3>Websites</h3><p class="st-lead">Pages built around the one action they have to earn.</p><p>Shopify storefronts, WordPress and Elementor sites, landing pages and advertorials, checked on every screen before launch.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://vendrato.com/websites">Vendrato websites</a></article>
<article>
<svg class="st-art" viewBox="0 0 120 84" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="8" width="30" height="68" rx="3"/><rect x="45" y="8" width="30" height="68" rx="3"/><rect x="84" y="8" width="30" height="68" rx="3"/><rect x="11" y="15" width="20" height="11" rx="1.5"/><rect x="11" y="31" width="20" height="11" rx="1.5"/><rect x="11" y="47" width="20" height="11" rx="1.5"/><rect x="50" y="15" width="20" height="11" rx="1.5"/><rect x="50" y="31" width="20" height="11" rx="1.5" class="hot"/><rect x="89" y="15" width="20" height="11" rx="1.5"/></svg>
<h3>CRM systems</h3><p class="st-lead">Every enquiry lands in the pipeline, with nothing retyped.</p><p>GoHighLevel funnels, forms, booking and lead capture. Larger setups, migration and team training are done with the rest of the studio.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://vendrato.com/crm">Vendrato CRM systems</a></article>
<article>
<svg class="st-art" viewBox="0 0 120 84" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="30" width="26" height="24" rx="3"/><rect x="47" y="8" width="26" height="24" rx="3" class="hot"/><rect x="47" y="52" width="26" height="24" rx="3"/><rect x="88" y="30" width="26" height="24" rx="3"/><path d="M32 38C40 38 39 20 47 20M32 46c8 0 7 18 15 18M73 20c8 0 7 18 15 18M73 64c8 0 7-18 15-18"/></svg>
<h3>Automations</h3><p class="st-lead">The next step happens on its own.</p><p>GoHighLevel workflows and Make or n8n scenarios that move data between your form, CRM and inbox, mapped first and tested before they run on real leads.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://vendrato.com/automations">Vendrato automations</a></article>
<article>
<svg class="st-art" viewBox="0 0 120 84" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="8" width="108" height="68" rx="3"/><path d="M6 22h108"/><circle cx="14" cy="15" r="1.6" class="dot"/><circle cx="21" cy="15" r="1.6" class="dot"/><path d="M22 50l12 12 24-26" class="tick"/><path d="M70 40h30M70 50h30M70 60h18"/></svg>
<h3>Care after launch</h3><p class="st-lead">The site you launched keeps working.</p><p>Four hours of support each month for minor revisions, security patches and routine upkeep. Larger changes are scoped separately.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://vendrato.com/websites">Vendrato maintenance</a></article>
</div>
<div class="st-sites">
<h3>More sites from our studio</h3>
<p class="st-sites-label">Client sites</p>
<ul class="st-grid">{studio.map(x=><li><a href={`https://vendrato.com/case-studies/${x.slug}/`}><img src={`/images/studio/${x.img}.webp`} width="480" height="333" loading="lazy" alt=""/><b>{x.name}</b><span>{x.kind}</span></a></li>)}</ul>
<p class="st-sites-label">Concept studies, one per trade</p>
<ul class="st-grid">{concepts.map(x=><li><a href={`https://vendrato.com/concept-studies/${x.slug}/`}><img src={`/images/studio/${x.slug}.webp`} width="480" height="270" loading="lazy" alt=""/><b>{x.name}</b><span>{x.trade}</span></a></li>)}</ul>
</div>
<p class="st-also">The studio also builds <a class="st-inline" href="https://vendrato.com/voice-ai">voice AI</a> and <a class="st-inline" href="https://vendrato.com/app-development">custom apps</a>, so you can add to the system without starting again with someone new.</p>
<dl class="st-facts"><div><dt>First</dt><dd>A free 30-minute call about your business and current setup</dd></div><div><dt>Then</dt><dd>A written scope and timeline, with weekly demos</dd></div><div><dt>At launch</dt><dd>Your code, accounts and documentation, in your name</dd></div></dl>
</div></section>
<ContactBand/>
</Site>
